 <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Sandking\">The Sandking</a> reappear. It is recommended to push their corpses to the walls so <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Sandking\">The Sandking</a> won't heal as easily.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Insects\">Insects</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Afflicted%20Strider\">Afflicted Strider</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Spawn%20of%20Morgathla\">Ancient Spawn of Morgathla</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Anmothra\">Anmothra</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berrypest\">Berrypest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blemished%20Spawn\">Blemished Spawn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Bug\">Blight Bug</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Parasite\">Brain Parasite</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bug</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bug</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Bug (Nostalgia)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burrowing%20Beetle\">Burrowing Beetle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Blue%29\">Butterfly (Blue)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\">Butterfly (Purple)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Red%29\">Butterfly (Red)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Yellow%29\">Butterfly (Yellow)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carnivorous%20Butterfly\">Carnivorous Butterfly</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Chimera\">Cave Chimera</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chasm%20Spawn\">Chasm Spawn</a></li><li><a h